//
// SQLite/Postgres parity note: every enum-like column is a plain `String`
// (Prisma native `enum` is unsupported on SQLite), validated by Zod/domain
// value objects at the repository boundary rather than by the DB engine.
// Money/amount fields are decimal strings for the same reason, converted to
// the domain `Money` value object's internal bigint at the boundary.
